PALIMPSEST_TURN {"text":"已完成并提交冷夜调度交班稿。\n\n## 核心结论\n\n以较晚的 **DUTY-2340（23:40）** 采集为准，覆盖 21:00 的 DESK-21。现行班表 `[80,40,70,50]` 在 01:00 格超过上限 50 kW，B 只能到 121 kWh，**缺 9 kWh**，已修订为：\n\n| 时段 | 车辆 | 楼宇负荷 | 充电设定 | 站点合计 |\n|---|---|---:|---:|---:|\n| 00:00–00:30 | A | 40 | **80 kW** | 120 |\n| 00:30–01:00 | A | 80 | **40 kW** | 120 |\n| 01:00–01:30 | B | 70 | **50 kW** | 120 |\n| 01:30–02:00 | B | 50 | **70 kW** | 120 |\n\n- 20 kW 可延负荷实际落在 **01:00 格**，总楼宇用电不削减。\n- A：离场 **126/126 kWh**，余量 **0**。\n- B：离场 **130/130 kWh**，余量 **0**。\n- 两车均刚好达标，实际效率、插枪时刻或负荷有任何偏差都会形成缺口。\n\n## 低效率放行决定\n\n- **η = 0.90**：双车放行，但零余量；这是临界点。\n- **η = 0.85**：`dispatchAt85: false`，**不放行双车**。A 只能到 123 kWh、B 只能到 127 kWh，各缺 3 kWh；合计缺 7.06 kWh AC（6 kWh 电池）。需减少任务、延长窗口或提高可用功率。\n\n## 提交文件\n\n- `shift-plan.json`：修订后的可执行四格排班。\n- `HANDOVER.md`：逐格设定、离场余量、记录冲突说明、85% 放行决定及签字前确认项。\n- `operations/duty-2340.json`：DUTY-2340 完整晚班回执，原样归档，`withinLimits: true`，离场 `[126,130]`。\n\n提交记录：班表修订 `8fcf289`，交班稿与回执 `d5ae2d3`。  \n备注：`node operations/retest.mjs` 仍按旧的 21:00 DESK-21 复算，会显示修订表在 01:30 超限；该记录已被 23:40 采集覆盖，不能作为明早放行依据。最终接受仍由值班负责人签字确认。","toolCalls":["tool/call:palimpsest_continuity","tool/result","tool/call:bash","tool/result","tool/call:depot_directory","tool/result","tool/call:bash","tool/result","tool/call:read","tool/result","tool/call:bash","tool/result","tool/call:read","tool/result","tool/call:bash","tool/result","tool/call:bash","tool/result","tool/call:depot_trial","tool/result","tool/call:depot_contact","tool/result","tool/call:bash","tool/result","tool/call:bash","tool/result","tool/call:bash","tool/result","tool/call:read","tool/call:read","tool/result","tool/result","tool/call:edit","tool/result","tool/call:bash","tool/result","tool/call:bash","tool/result","tool/call:depot_contact","tool/result","tool/call:write","tool/result","tool/call:write","tool/result","tool/call:bash","tool/result","tool/call:bash","tool/result","tool/call:read","tool/result","tool/call:edit","tool/result","tool/call:bash","tool/result","tool/